 },
 "summary": "A miniature surface-mount tact switch with a 3.90 × 3.00 mm body, a round 1.80 mm plunger and two flat surface-mount terminals, one at each end of the 3.90 mm length. Pressing the plunger closes a single normally open contact between terminals 1 and 2; it is rated 50 mA at 12 V DC. The ordering code selects the dome metal, a locating post, the overall height (1.8, 2.0 or 2.5 mm) and the operating force (160 g or 260 g). TS-1088-AR02016 has a stainless steel dome, no post, 2.0 mm height and 160 g force.",
